ails, visit semgrep.dev/legal/rules-license\",\"vulnerability_class\":[\"Hard-coded Secrets\"],\"source\":\"https://semgrep.dev/r/javascript.lang.hardcoded.strings.detected-private-key.detected-private-key\",\"shortlink\":\"https://sg.run/2dRY\",\"semgrep.dev\":{\"rule\":{\"origin\":\"pro_rules\",\"r_id\":40963,\"rule_id\":\"6JUA6p\",\"rv_id\":1236745,\"url\":\"https://semgrep.dev/playground/r/JdTz4Rj/javascript.lang.hardcoded.strings.detected-private-key.detected-private-key\",\"version_id\":\"JdTz4Rj\"}}},\"severity\":\"WARNING\",\"fingerprint\":\"e9a9e37d9cbb3d3820ae1d6b46d9b2e67b1f1b27c775004fecf2050f589d0acd64febc7aa9d8a7b726ab97bb655e70ccf5df58eedd3078148d098cde22f9f0d3_0\",\"lines\":\"const privateKey = '-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\\\\r\\\\\\\\r\\\\n-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----'\",\"is_ignored\":false,\"validation_state\":\"NO_VALIDATOR\",\"engine_kind\":\"PRO\"}},{\"check_id\":\"javascript.node-stdlib.cryptography.crypto-weak-algorithm.crypto-weak-algorithm\",\"path\":\"lib/insecurity.ts\",\"start\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":57,\"offset\":2270},\"end\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":62,\"offset\":2275},\"extra\":{\"metavars\":{\"$1\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1,\"col\":1,\"offset\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1,\"col\":5,\"offset\":4},\"abstract_content\":\"'md5\"},\"$CRYPTO\":{\"start\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":39,\"offset\":2252},\"end\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":45,\"offset\":2258},\"abstract_content\":\"crypto\"},\"$ALG\":{\"start\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":57,\"offset\":2270},\"end\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":62,\"offset\":2275},\"abstract_content\":\"'md5'\"},\"$SINK\":{\"start\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":57,\"offset\":2270},\"end\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":62,\"offset\":2275},\"abstract_content\":\"'md5'\"}},\"message\":\"The use of a weak cryptographic algorithm (e.g., SHA-1 or MD5) has been identified. These algorithms are considered insecure due to vulnerabilities that make them susceptible to collision attacks, allowing attackers to compromise data integrity or security. Replace SHA-1 or MD5 with secure hashing algorithms, such as: SHA-256 or higher (e.g., SHA-3).\",\"metadata\":{\"likelihood\":\"LOW\",\"impact\":\"HIGH\",\"confidence\":\"HIGH\",\"category\":\"security\",\"subcategory\":[\"vuln\"],\"cwe\":[\"CWE-327: Use of a Broken or Risky Cryptographic Algorithm\"],\"display-name\":\"Use of a Broken or Risky Cryptographic Algorithm\",\"functional-categories\":[\"crypto::search::randomness::crypto\",\"crypto::search::randomness::webcrypto\"],\"owasp\":[\"A02:2021 - Cryptographic Failures\",\"A03:2017 - Sensitive Data Exposure\",\"A04:2025 - Cryptographic Failures\"],\"references\":[\"https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/A04_2025-Cryptographic_Failures/\",\"https://owasp.org/Top10/A02_2021-Cryptographic_Failures\"],\"technology\":[\"WebCryptoAPI\",\"crypto\",\"node\",\"webcrypto\"],\"license\":\"Semgrep Rules License v1.0. For more details, visit semgrep.dev/legal/rules-license\",\"vulnerability_class\":[\"Cryptographic Issues\"],\"source\":\"https://semgrep.dev/r/javascript.node-stdlib.cryptography.crypto-weak-algorithm.crypto-weak-algorithm\",\"shortlink\":\"https://sg.run/nJgp1\",\"semgrep.dev\":{\"rule\":{\"origin\":\"pro_rules\",\"r_id\":156180,\"rule_id\":\"ZqUQAnR\",\"rv_id\":1236788,\"url\":\"https://semgrep.dev/playground/r/PkTRK33/javascript.node-stdlib.cryptography.crypto-weak-algorithm.crypto-weak-algorithm\",\"version_id\":\"PkTRK33\"}}},\"severity\":\"WARNING\",\"fingerprint\":\"812786da92a1aad7a9b37716f3af91ec4e26116f7a2f09939f1f8522122dc7913c5f2f3aca178200a6ecad3d7a6dc0b0f2aa5331885867a5cae50f1acde3ebd1_0\",\"lines\":\"export const hash = (data: string) => crypto.createHash('md5').update(data).digest('hex')\",\"is_ignored\":false,\"validation_state\":\"NO_VALIDATOR\",\"dataflow_trace\":{\"taint_source\":[\"CliLoc\",[{\"path\":\"lib/insecurity.ts\",\"start\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":57,\"offset\":2270},\"end\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":62,\"offset\":2275}},\"'md5'\"]],\"intermediate_vars\":[],\"taint_sink\":[\"CliLoc\",[{\"path\":\"lib/insecurity.ts\",\"sta