llowing attackers to compromise data integrity or security. Replace SHA-1 or MD5 with secure hashing algorithms, such as: SHA-256 or higher (e.g., SHA-3).\",\"metadata\":{\"likelihood\":\"LOW\",\"impact\":\"HIGH\",\"confidence\":\"HIGH\",\"category\":\"security\",\"subcategory\":[\"vuln\"],\"cwe\":[\"CWE-327: Use of a Broken or Risky Cryptographic Algorithm\"],\"display-name\":\"Use of a Broken or Risky Cryptographic Algorithm\",\"functional-categories\":[\"crypto::search::randomness::crypto\",\"crypto::search::randomness::webcrypto\"],\"owasp\":[\"A02:2021 - Cryptographic Failures\",\"A03:2017 - Sensitive Data Exposure\",\"A04:2025 - Cryptographic Failures\"],\"references\":[\"https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/A04_2025-Cryptographic_Failures/\",\"https://owasp.org/Top10/A02_2021-Cryptographic_Failures\"],\"technology\":[\"WebCryptoAPI\",\"crypto\",\"node\",\"webcrypto\"],\"license\":\"Semgrep Rules License v1.0. For more details, visit semgrep.dev/legal/rules-license\",\"vulnerability_class\":[\"Cryptographic Issues\"],\"source\":\"https://semgrep.dev/r/javascript.node-stdlib.cryptography.crypto-weak-algorithm.crypto-weak-algorithm\",\"shortlink\":\"https://sg.run/nJgp1\",\"semgrep.dev\":{\"rule\":{\"origin\":\"pro_rules\",\"r_id\":156180,\"rule_id\":\"ZqUQAnR\",\"rv_id\":1236788,\"url\":\"https://semgrep.dev/playground/r/PkTRK33/javascript.node-stdlib.cryptography.crypto-weak-algorithm.crypto-weak-algorithm\",\"version_id\":\"PkTRK33\"}}},\"severity\":\"WARNING\",\"fingerprint\":\"812786da92a1aad7a9b37716f3af91ec4e26116f7a2f09939f1f8522122dc7913c5f2f3aca178200a6ecad3d7a6dc0b0f2aa5331885867a5cae50f1acde3ebd1_0\",\"lines\":\"export const hash = (data: string) => crypto.createHash('md5').update(data).digest('hex')\",\"is_ignored\":false,\"validation_state\":\"NO_VALIDATOR\",\"dataflow_trace\":{\"taint_source\":[\"CliLoc\",[{\"path\":\"lib/insecurity.ts\",\"start\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":57,\"offset\":2270},\"end\":{\"line\":43,\"col\":62,\"offset\":2275}},\"'md5'\"]],\"inte